  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​Tecsack​​Software​​delivers​​projects​​through​​a​​structured​​but​​flexible​​methodology​​built​​around​\n​four​​phases:​​Discovery,​​Integration​​Design,​​Incremental​​Delivery,​​and​​Responsible​​Rollout.​​The​\n​same​​methodology​​applies​​whether​​the​​engagement​​is​​a​​platform​​build,​​an​​AI/RAG​​integration,​\n​or a modernization project — only the specifics of each phase change with the project's scope.​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​Table of Contents​",
      "​1. Overview​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​The​​approach​​is​​designed​​around​​one​​principle:​​ship​​a​​working​​capability​​against​​real​​data​​early,​\n​then iterate — rather than a long build cycle before anything is usable by the client.​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​Table of Contents​",
      "​1. Overview​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
