  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​Because​​every​​engagement​​runs​​on​​the​​same​​core​​platform​​—​​a​​single​​.NET​​backend,​​Angular​\n​frontend,​​and​​.NET​​MAUI/Xamarin​​mobile​​layer​​—​​the​​Discovery​​and​​Integration​​Design​​phases​\n​can​ ​move​ ​faster​ ​than​ ​a​ ​from-scratch​ ​build:​ ​there​ ​is​ ​one​ ​existing​ ​system​ ​to​ ​understand,​ ​not​\n​several.​​This​​is​​also​​what​​makes​​the​​Incremental​​Delivery​​phase​​possible​​early​​in​​a​​project​​—​\n​new​​capability​​plugs​​into​​infrastructure​​the​​client​​is​​often​​already​​running,​​rather​​than​​requiring​​a​\n​new environment before anything can be demonstrated.​",
